Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.61,0:00:09.04,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,600)\shad3\blur1\fs60\c&HF1F1F1&}Episode 13 \N {\fs100} Snow
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.00,Sign,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.12,0:00:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not an exaggeration when I say my mind and body froze over. {this is a sentence caught in the middle of a conversation}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.62,0:00:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.91,0:00:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,More of your anecdotes, Senior Apprentice? {anideshi} {?????}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.77,0:00:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No-no, this one's a true story.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.43,0:00:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a tale that makes \Nmy blood run cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.26,0:01:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... It's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.51,0:01:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, please come closer \Nand pour me another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.75,0:01:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure. Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.02,0:01:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Good stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.62,0:01:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, it happened on one creepy night \Nwhen it was snowing just like tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.58,0:01:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a story from when I \Nwas still in wizard training.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.42,0:01:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,At that time, training was tough \Nand we always finished at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.72,0:01:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what I did, \NI always ended up feeling cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.01,0:01:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My word, I've never been more grateful \Nfor the wizardry than back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.04,0:01:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn, burn! Burn to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.48,0:01:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.14,0:01:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.76,0:01:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.40,0:01:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.03,0:01:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.35,0:01:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's close! {??????????}{近いな}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.24,0:01:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,A Snow Woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.35,0:01:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, you fatty boy, \Nhave you had enough? {???}{凍ておしまい; taking some liberty here because you don't really offer people death by freezing like that}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.78,0:02:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.45,0:02:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking good!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.24,0:02:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now... shrink!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.00,0:02:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This will make a fine addition for my collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.68,0:02:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what the Snow Woman said \Nbefore walking away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.48,0:02:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It was probably because I was so adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.57,0:02:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So what happened next?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.34,0:02:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I'll need another cup \Nto remember well what happened next.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.99,0:02:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.20,0:02:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So then, the Snow Woman \Ntook me to her place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.53,0:02:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And just from looking at it, \Nyou could tell it was a Snow Woman's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.37,0:02:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's when I saw that there was a crying woman, \Nencased in ice next to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.31,0:02:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a real man, so I couldn't bear to just watch her and say nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.69,0:02:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I stretched my limbs and broke my ice cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.18,0:02:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If the opponent's a Snow Woman, \Nthen I was to be Fudou Myouou! {Acala (Wisdom King); Acalanatha; Fudō Myōō (Myō-ō); fierce Buddhist deity​}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.01,0:02:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Snow Woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.43,0:02:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Snow Girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.74,0:02:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I will melt you with this fire sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.10,0:03:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.01,0:03:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're planning to melt me ​​with that sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.34,0:03:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't hear it! {there being no use in arguing (about it); not up for discussion​}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.50,0:03:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.57,0:03:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.71,0:03:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, blazes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.84,0:03:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,One way or another, \NI'm a man through and through!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.04,0:03:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to melt you with my heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.55,0:03:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.82,0:03:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how do you like it? Like it? Like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.95,0:03:54.56,Overlap,,0,0,0,,S-Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.58,0:04:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, she melted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.98,0:04:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, what a spicy taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.04,0:04:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So what happened afterwards?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.14,0:04:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There was so much flirting going on \Nthat we didn't even have time to kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.05,0:04:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.63,0:04:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it—\Nand what about that woman in ice? {???????????}{人形 is used to refer to that woman encased in ice later on}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.96,0:04:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you just listen to the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.16,0:04:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I quickly ran away \Nwith the ice-enclosed woman. {actually "doll"}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.26,0:04:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And that woman is still my wife to this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.90,0:04:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You were so heroic back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.90,0:04:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I think that not saving her \Nmight've been preferable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.80,0:04:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then. \NThat was a night of stories, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.60,0:04:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it about time to stretch my back. {hoping it's about his waist and not "mikoshi; portable Shinto shrine carried through the streets during festivals​"}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.52,0:04:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll come again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.61,0:04:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still snowing a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.19,0:04:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And I drank so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.59,0:04:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing that snowy night tale was just fiction. {???????}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.26,0:04:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wandering in a blizzard at night is so fun... {??????}{夜の吹雪は楽しい}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.04,0:05:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that an optical illusion or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.70,0:05:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.42,0:05:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Snow Woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.26,0:05:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So she's here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.44,0:05:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Might as well follow the plot of the tale for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.26,0:05:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.04,0:05:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared when you make a face like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.76,0:05:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't come close! \NI might melt!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.73,0:05:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.74,0:05:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I {\i1}am{\i0} melting, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.33,0:05:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you just want to make me \Nlet my guard down to freeze me in ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.28,0:05:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I'd ever fall for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.00,0:05:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm so cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.26,0:05:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The cold one here is me. {lit: I'm the one who's cold}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.62,0:05:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.33,0:05:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a naïve guy. {????}{what she's saying is that he's easy to deceive}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And your chest hair is like a brush! {scrubbing brush; scourer​ - no clue what she means by that}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.79,0:06:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This is too good for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.26,0:06:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I was really wrong about you. {ESL moment}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.74,0:06:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to know me better?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.47,0:07:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear, don't tell me \Nthe dance was not to your liking?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.12,0:07:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It was all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.79,0:07:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about this dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.81,0:07:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.35,0:07:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I feel like dancing too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.33,0:07:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.56,0:07:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You make my heart do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.98,0:07:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my! It's burning!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.26,0:07:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like my whole body is on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.25,0:07:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help you cool it down, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.26,0:07:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.42,0:07:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like all of my \Nbody heat's been sucked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.05,0:08:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What time is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.48,0:08:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, it's the morning star!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.46,0:08:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotta get home soon, or else...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.56,0:08:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be faster this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.63,0:08:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.05,0:08:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Phew, thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.11,0:08:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She's still fast asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.43,0:08:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{????? i feel like he said it before but it's 5 am so brain no worky, is it just his cry for casting a spell?}{isn't he just saying 痒い? If you've had to reheat yourself you should know it itches from the inside}Itchy, itchy, itchy. {idk how to properly express it though...}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.60,0:08:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! No good! All the body parts \Nthat I caressed her with are frostbitten! {霜焼け = frostbite}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.48,0:08:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how itchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.59,0:09:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Itchy, itchy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.67,0:09:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And here too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.21,0:09:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Here too...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.41,0:09:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I can't reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.34,0:09:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, what happened to you, Husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.04,0:09:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing, I was just training with Elder and... {??????}{寒稽古}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.71,0:09:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he really gave me no quarter. \NHey, won't you apply this to my back?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.16,0:09:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Around here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.46,0:09:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There, right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.90,0:09:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Must've been one hell of a training. {???????}{大変な稽古ね}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.46,0:09:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What's taking you, hey?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.48,0:09:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Just put it on there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.05,0:09:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.32,0:09:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you so angry about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.11,0:09:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey, my love?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.97,0:09:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,On such a cold evening, \Nour futon is the best place to train.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.39,0:09:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.19,0:09:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I can make you feel better. {lit: fix your mood}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.44,0:10:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.36,0:10:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.26,0:10:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand it! {kuyashi? = regrettable}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.40,0:10:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So cold... {?????}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.79,0:10:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,She's colder than any Snow Woman!
